{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as the Monster \u2013 Experience a colossal Troll.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Beast Is Yet To Come, a ferocious 3D action roguelite, take control of a towering Troll built for destruction. Survive against relentless hordes, navigate shifting battlefields shaped by dynamic weather, and master the primal art of combat through visceral \u201cpunch hell\u201d combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/86d15dd456af3a40cbf6b19478c067ff.poster.avif?t=1766499660\" width=720 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/86d15dd456af3a40cbf6b19478c067ff.webm?t=1766499660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/86d15dd456af3a40cbf6b19478c067ff.mp4?t=1766499660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insane fun smashing hordes of enemies with brutal melee combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Monster \u2013 Experience 2 playable characters, a colossal Troll or a powerful Giantess.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/545adf3ff312b77cce49c4668301842e.avif?t=1766499660\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+90 skills to unlock and upgrade (70+ in the full version).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 maps with different biomes: Taiga, Tundra, and Temperate Forest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/27943a08f574873815257a3795fbf738.poster.avif?t=1766499660\" width=720 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/27943a08f574873815257a3795fbf738.webm?t=1766499660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/27943a08f574873815257a3795fbf738.mp4?t=1766499660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite Evolution \u2013 Unlock skills like Uppercut and Berserk Rage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support \u2013 Fully optimized for gamepad play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, with rain and fog effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/29a864a5b8df493112e8c2db63556f1d.poster.avif?t=1766499660\" width=720 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/29a864a5b8df493112e8c2db63556f1d.webm?t=1766499660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/extras/29a864a5b8df493112e8c2db63556f1d.mp4?t=1766499660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique enemy types with distinct behaviors and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps lasting 15 to 30 minutes, giving you the option to play a fast-paced casual game or a longer session.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Power ups to enhance your abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i